  "text": "Linear vs Jira: why every fast-moving tech company is leaving Jira behind. Product managers spend hours configuring complex Jira workflows while engineers avoid updating their tickets. Jira's bloated custom fields and slow load times turn sprint tracking into a bureaucratic bottleneck. Linear solves this using lightning-fast keyboard shortcuts, automated GitHub syncs, and clean weekly cycles. You eliminate administrative bloat and ship code faster.",
